00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:14.320
I'm terrified to go in my classroom. If he wants to open schools how about he provide teachers with hazard pay?

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:19.680
He can drop my dead body right here.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:24.640
Los Angeles was the first major city to announce that its public schools wouldn't be reopening

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.640
for in-person instruction in the fall.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:32.960
83 percent of LAUSD teachers agree with the union's recommendation that teachers and students

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:35.340
not physically return to schools in August.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:38.280
How do you do six feet social distancing?

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:40.800
How do you do that in passing periods?

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:43.820
